        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"f1ae57ed-c18b-4efa-8e55-996ecdd15542\",\"review_text\":\"Ggg you\"},{\"review_id\":\"ea7e7a97-98e0-48d6-8e3d-436b5f94aa81\",\"review_text\":\"Currently experiencing issues especially if WiFi or Mobile data are off. How come the downloaded music for offline mode is not playing despite multiple updates?\"},{\"review_id\":\"91e69717-0266-471a-8f36-b4e7efa7012d\",\"review_text\":\"Bhut bakbas aap hai ye ek to ads bhut deta hai upar se network error batata hai or kisi song me jaldi lyric bhi nhi deta 😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡\"},{\"review_id\":\"091abc73-6504-40e9-bb0b-7aca0c994415\",\"review_text\":\"This app has got horrible, the updates they have come up with makes no sense, they are just trying terrible ways of forcing people to get premium. Imo Spotify will no longer be the same.\"},{\"review_id\":\"b9f12425-9f66-4b0d-9b6f-b619344d80cd\",\"review_text\":\"Amazing app the only negative is how loud the ads are in the free version. It's my most used app there is rarely a song I can't find.\"},{\"review_id\":\"7d1c3b0d-c45b-4dad-bca8-e99754fc2403\",\"review_text\":\"Help me a lot about different music\"},{\"review_id\":\"e9e258a1-88db-4ce1-8aba-6934cff3789c\",\"review_text\":\"Some songs won't load it's lyrics / don't have lyrics.\"},{\"review_id\":\"74c7fc31-1720-435e-a3e3-4b9545c286fc\",\"review_text\":\"After update very bad experience we cannot go in back songs....and for the lyrics we have to pay money 😑\"},{\"review_id\":\"bb72a6a5-2711-4888-9ed4-20ba00f6fdff\",\"review_text\":\"My kpop music station... Kinda wish for HiFi tho\"},{\"review_id\":\"7ef3e744-6806-4e81-a5bc-e51dd5714d7d\",\"review_text\":\"T's good\"}]}"
